    "ImageDescription": {
      "value": "<i>The Mesopotamian Campaign, 1916-1918</i><br>\n<p>Capture Turkish guns and material at Aziziya. This village was occupied by the British on 4/5 March 1917; General Sir F S Maude making his advanced Headquarters here.\n</p>\nNote a mixture of British and Indian troops in the background.",
